  "id": "differential-psychology",
  "term": "differential psychology",
  "definition": "Differential psychology is the area of psychology that studies how people differ from one another across traits and abilities such as cognitive intelligence, emotional intelligence, personality, and creativity. It also examines how these different individual differences are related and overlap.",
